The third link of the chain is the discovery root the playbook was found under, so a shared library
kept beside the playbooks — `_playbooks/_lib/` — is reachable from any of them by a root-relative
name. `_`-prefixed entries are skipped by discovery, so `_lib` is never mistaken for a playbook.

-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/_lib/shared.md --
HOME-ROOT-SHARED
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-inc-root/playbook.md --
---
name: fx-inc-root
title: Include Root
summary: Root-relative include resolved from the discovery root.
jinja: true
---

Preamble.
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-inc-root/playbook.yaml --
graph:
  one: []
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-inc-root/one/prompt.md --
---
name: one
summary: Only step.
detached: sonnet:medium
---

